abstract: "A Model Context Protocol server with 43 read-only tools over a national directory of 144,000+ U.S. veteran resources (VA facilities, Vet Centers, county veterans service officers, VA-accredited representatives, housing, employment and mental-health programs), VA benefits references, PACT Act presumptive conditions, Veterans Crisis Line routing and the official giving details for Wounded Warriors. Operated by Wounded Warriors, a national 501(c)(3) public charity (EIN 86-1336741) based in The Woodlands, Texas. Data licensed CC BY 4.0; code licensed MIT."
keywords:
